    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "Adopts what a hiqlite node does between process start and process exit: the startup order, how a node resolves its own identity and listen addresses, how a fresh node 1 initializes, how every other node joins as learner and then voter, what the reset escape hatch destroys, which background tasks are spawned and owned by nobody, and what the split-brain checker observes. Six defects are recorded, four of them new and two executed. Documents HQL_SPLIT_BRAIN_INTERVAL, closing F-011. Repairs no runtime behavior.\n",
